 word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold;\">Письмо клиенту до оплаты:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 25px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; color: #333333; line-height: 1.5; font-family: \'Fira Sans Condensed\', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><img style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 1px solid #eeeeee; vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" title=\"Подтверждение заказа цифрового товара в магазине OkayCMS\" src=\"https://okay-cms.com/files/uploads/digital_tovar_OkayCMS1.png\" alt=\"Подтверждение заказа цифрового товара в магазине OkayCMS\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 25px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; color: #333333; line-height: 1.5; font-family: \'Fira Sans Condensed\', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold;\">Письмо клиенту после оплаты заказа:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 25px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; color: #333333; line-height: 1.5; font-family: \'Fira Sans Condensed\', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><img style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 1px solid #eeeeee; vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" title=\"Ссылка на скачивание цифрового товара\" src=\"https://okay-cms.com/files/uploads/digital_tovar_OkayCMS2.png\" alt=\"Ссылка на скачивание цифрового товара\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 25px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; color: #333333; line-height: 1.5; font-family: \'Fira Sans Condensed\', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">3. Получение клиентом заказанного товара:</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 25px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; color: #333333; line-height: 1.5; font-family: \'Fira Sans Condensed\', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><img style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; border: 1px solid #eeeeee; vertical-align: 